					"speakerTitle": "羅叔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711061302,
					"content": "#不過，{F#妳}{M#你}們看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711061303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "羅叔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711061303,
					"content": "哇啊！清理完元素沉積物，居然會流出茶水…不對，這個好像只是普通的水？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
